[ROCm] Add a global symbol version linker script to avoid LLVM symbol clashes.

With --dynamic_mode=fully, XLA's own LLVM symbols clash with those of ROCm's
prebuilt libLLVM.so. This adds an opt-in toolchain feature that stamps a
symbol version onto everything XLA exports. Enable with:
  --@rules_ml_toolchain//common:enable_xla_test_global_symbol_version=True

Backport of upstream rules_ml_toolchain PR #307 (merged as
e8709f15382e4da1de5ca15672cb4412da3d989d).
Drop this patch once rules_ml_toolchain is bumped past that commit.

